BACKEND HANDOFF DOCUMENT
TravelGenie AI – Backend Integration Guide
1. Project Overview
Project Name

TravelGenie AI

Theme

Autonomous Personal Assistant Agent for Multi-Step Real-World Tasks

Objective

The backend acts as the central orchestrator.

It is responsible for:

receiving user requests
orchestrating all AI agents
calling external APIs
maintaining workflow state
storing execution results
returning the final travel plan

The frontend NEVER communicates directly with Lyzr.

