5. Polling Strategy
Submit request via POST /api/workflow.
Receive workflow_id.
Poll GET /api/workflow/{workflow_id} every 2–3 seconds.
When status is completed, call GET /api/workflow/{workflow_id}/result.
Render the complete report.
6. Error Handling
If the backend returns partial_success, show available results with a warning banner.
If workflow status is failed, display a retry option.
Handle network errors with retry messaging rather than clearing the user's request.
